{"5061840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trade or Threat", "steam_appid": 5061840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/extras/502399c1ad960fe798f16545aaf8fd66.avif?t=1786643286\" width=1170 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/extras/e7d9674746faf324d552bf3a1b343a18.poster.avif?t=1786643286\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/extras/e7d9674746faf324d552bf3a1b343a18.webm?t=1786643286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/extras/e7d9674746faf324d552bf3a1b343a18.mp4?t=1786643286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a medieval shop stocked with goods recovered from dangerous dungeons. Arrange your stock, serve unusual customers, and decide which deals are worth the risk. The boss sets the rules, and some goods may be forbidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/extras/1cb256d77228407829b78752fcc98704.avif?t=1786643286\" width=1170 height=140 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/extras/b1472ebe7cd46cdfdf7e5f1cc8508080.poster.avif?t=1786643286\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/extras/b1472ebe7cd46cdfdf7e5f1cc8508080.webm?t=1786643286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/extras/b1472ebe7cd46cdfdf7e5f1cc8508080.mp4?t=1786643286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the dungeon after dark to search for valuable loot. Open locked chests, avoid traps, hide from enemies, and escape with what you can carry. Inventory space is limited, so every piece of loot matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/extras/a4683b34979a25f924e0ab77493aecad.avif?t=1786643286\" width=1170 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/extras/81cf09502c49c74e371744c55c9a033f.poster.avif?t=1786643286\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/extras/81cf09502c49c74e371744c55c9a033f.webm?t=1786643286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/extras/81cf09502c49c74e371744c55c9a033f.mp4?t=1786643286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The boss expects regular payments. Make enough profit before the deadline—or face the consequences. Sell by day. Loot by night. Pay what you owe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROFIT OR PLAY IT SAFE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selling forbidden goods can earn you more gold, but illegal business comes with consequences. Follow the boss’s rules for a safer life, or break them to increase your profits—and the danger surrounding your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your earnings on upgrades that help you carry more loot, open better locks, and discover new ways to recover valuable items.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person shopkeeping and dungeon exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A day-and-night gameplay loop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physical items and limited inventory space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous traps, enemies, locked chests, and hiding spots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legal and forbidden goods with different risks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop, equipment, and exploration upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark medieval atmosphere combining cozy trading with dungeon tension</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/extras/502399c1ad960fe798f16545aaf8fd66.avif?t=1786643286\" width=1170 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/extras/e7d9674746faf324d552bf3a1b343a18.poster.avif?t=1786643286\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/extras/e7d9674746faf324d552bf3a1b343a18.webm?t=1786643286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/extras/e7d9674746faf324d552bf3a1b343a18.mp4?t=1786643286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a medieval shop stocked with goods recovered from dangerous dungeons. Arrange your stock, serve unusual customers, and decide which deals are worth the risk. The boss sets the rules, and some goods may be forbidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/extras/1cb256d77228407829b78752fcc98704.avif?t=1786643286\" width=1170 height=140 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/extras/b1472ebe7cd46cdfdf7e5f1cc8508080.poster.avif?t=1786643286\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/extras/b1472ebe7cd46cdfdf7e5f1cc8508080.webm?t=1786643286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/extras/b1472ebe7cd46cdfdf7e5f1cc8508080.mp4?t=1786643286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the dungeon after dark to search for valuable loot. Open locked chests, avoid traps, hide from enemies, and escape with what you can carry. Inventory space is limited, so every piece of loot matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/extras/a4683b34979a25f924e0ab77493aecad.avif?t=1786643286\" width=1170 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/extras/81cf09502c49c74e371744c55c9a033f.poster.avif?t=1786643286\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/extras/81cf09502c49c74e371744c55c9a033f.webm?t=1786643286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/extras/81cf09502c49c74e371744c55c9a033f.mp4?t=1786643286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The boss expects regular payments. Make enough profit before the deadline—or face the consequences. Sell by day. Loot by night. Pay what you owe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROFIT OR PLAY IT SAFE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selling forbidden goods can earn you more gold, but illegal business comes with consequences. Follow the boss’s rules for a safer life, or break them to increase your profits—and the danger surrounding your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your earnings on upgrades that help you carry more loot, open better locks, and discover new ways to recover valuable items.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person shopkeeping and dungeon exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A day-and-night gameplay loop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physical items and limited inventory space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous traps, enemies, locked chests, and hiding spots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legal and forbidden goods with different risks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop, equipment, and exploration upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark medieval atmosphere combining cozy trading with dungeon tension</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Trade or Threat is a first-person shopkeeping and dungeon-crawling simulation where you sell goods by day and search for valuable loot after dark. Earn enough gold to repay your debt to the boss while balancing profit, danger, and the rules imposed on your shop.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/50fc8de03fc813f682e9ca215b16e0b2d064100b/header.jpg?t=1786643286", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/1080f28eb069d689e76a897f68f1385390dcc363/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786643286", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061840/1080f28eb069d689e76a897f68f1385390dcc363/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786643286", "website": "https:/